WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:04.030 --> 00:00:08.120
It's all right! Now let's move forward

3
00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:11.590
with the sun always in our hearts

4
00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:15.030
As power passes through our clasped hands

5
00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:18.680
Let's grab hold of our wishes

6
00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:32.510
Working together, let's ride the giant waves

7
00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:40.330
Let's hurry toward the excitement--
there's the starting signal

8
00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:47.140
Now's the time to set sail-- let's raise anchor

9
00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:55.000
Cut through the rainbow-colored wind
and head for a sea of adventure

10
00:00:55.130 --> 00:00:58.570
It'll be a journey fraught with injury

11
00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:02.300
but what you cherish most will be right there

12
00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:06.430
And if you get into a jam

13
00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:08.380
I'll always be there to protect you

14
00:01:09.530 --> 00:01:13.360
It's all right! Now let's move forward

15
00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:16.850
with the sun always in our hearts

16
00:01:17.230 --> 00:01:20.350
If a storm hits, let's put
our arms around each other

17
00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:24.230
and gaze at the light beyond

18
00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:27.970
If we gather up the pieces of our dreams

19
00:01:28.470 --> 00:01:31.580
they'll make a map leading to tomorrow

20
00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:34.750
So let's grab hold of our wishes

21
00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:40.480
under the same flag-- together, we're one

22
00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:51.970
<b>Donut Race!!</b>

23
00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:54.590
All right! While everyone's
busy with their boats, I'll explain how the race works!

24
00:01:55.030 --> 00:01:58.420
The course will be one lap
around Long Ring Long Land!

25
00:01:58.420 --> 00:02:01.710
It might sound easy, but it's anything but!

26
00:02:02.490 --> 00:02:06.050
A team is immediately out of
the race should their boat sink!

27
00:02:06.050 --> 00:02:08.840
In addition, all weapons are allowed

28
00:02:08.840 --> 00:02:11.640
even guns, cannons, explosives,
cutlasses, or anything else!

29
00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:15.390
Whoever complains about unfairness
will be shamed as a pirate!

30
00:02:16.890 --> 00:02:18.590
Porche-chan!

31
00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:20.130
I hope you sink nose dude!

32
00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:21.510
Me?!

33
00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:23.910
We have to win now!

34
00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:26.150
Sinking opponents is fair game.

35
00:02:26.150 --> 00:02:27.450
I'm getting excited!

36
00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:28.740
Do we even have a chance?

37
00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:33.490
Listen up Usopp! Anything happens
to the ladies and I'll filet you!

38
00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:36.410
We will win!

39
00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:39.190
Oh my. Listen to that crazy talk.

40
00:02:39.190 --> 00:02:43.260
Let 'em talk Porche-chan.
We'll sink 'em in three minutes!

41
00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:45.320
Right Monda?!

42
00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:51.600
Fool! No one's ever beat us
in an orthodox-rules game!

43
00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:56.500
Think this race will last
five minutes Hamburg?

44
00:02:57.630 --> 00:02:58.590
Nope.

45
00:02:59.710 --> 00:03:04.600
Now take these Eternal Poses
so that you don't get lost!

46
00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:07.220
Lost?

47
00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:11.700
Leave the island? Why would we do that?

48
00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:14.200
We're taking the shortest route along the inside track!

49
00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:16.120
I don't think it'll be that simple...

50
00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:18.790
Okay! On your marks!

51
00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:21.750
Ready!

52
00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:22.540
Why won't it be so simple?!

53
00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:23.460
Just trust me!

54
00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:25.300
Leave the shore as soon as we start!

55
00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:26.540
Why?!

56
00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:27.700
You're mine.

57
00:03:29.570 --> 00:03:31.120
Donut!

58
00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:33.690
I've got a bad feeling about this!

59
00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:35.000
Tell us why!

60
00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:38.590
Push it! Push it! Push it!

61
00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:44.510
We're gonna teach ya what
this boat exists for!

62
00:03:48.350 --> 00:03:50.350
Oh no! We're too late!

63
00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:51.100
What are these?

64
00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:52.570
Are these traps?

65
00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:54.560
N-Nami! Don't...!

66
00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:08.380
And there they are! The Mothership
Coaster's infamous Barrel Mines!

67
00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:15.170
See you later!

68
00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:18.010
Don't sink right away though!
Give us some fun!

69
00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:25.720
Capote! Give 'em a taste
of your Fishman Karate!

70
00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:26.180
Right!

71
00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:28.820
Sea Surface Splitter!

72
00:04:32.610 --> 00:04:34.430
The boat's come apart!

73
00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:38.550
Our balance...!

74
00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:39.800
Take this!

75
00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:41.930
Special Attack: Flame Star!

76
00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:43.720
That won't work!

77
00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:45.810
Ocho Fleurs!
Eight Flowers

78
00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:48.120
What the...?!

79
00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:50.080
Capote!

80
00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:51.620
Flip!

81
00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:53.660
Oh no!

82
00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:56.110
Yes! Now's our chance!

83
00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:59.030
Usopp swim and pull the boat!

84
00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:00.070
Don't be crazy!

85
00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:02.800
Capote! Monda! Pull yourselves together!

86
00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:04.030
Paddle! Paddle!

87
00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:06.700
Let's get to it, Hamburg.

88
00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:09.840
Really? It's finally time, Boss?

89
00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:15.520
All right! Currently in the lead
is the adorable Cutie Wagon!

90
00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:17.280
In second is the Barrel Tiger.

91
00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:20.140
Oh, yeah! Usopp! Use a dial!

92
00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:21.230
O-Oh right!

93
00:05:21.230 --> 00:05:23.260
All right! I'll use this Breath Dial to...!

94
00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:27.250
Paddling would be faster than this!

95
00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:29.390
Don't you have a Jet Dial?!

96
00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:31.440
Those are impossible to get!

97
00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:33.420
One of our crew members is on the line here!

98
00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:36.300
Yeah! That's the issue!

99
00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:41.970
If we end up losing, they'll definitely take me first!

100
00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:46.350
I can't let that happen! I'm too cute!

101
00:05:46.350 --> 00:05:48.190
You wish. Now just paddle.

102
00:05:52.110 --> 00:05:54.800
What?! This is no time for reading, Robin!

103
00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:55.700
I'm paddling too.

104
00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:59.320
Your hands are, but you don't seem like you're...

105
00:05:59.320 --> 00:06:00.850
Yeah, Robin...

106
00:06:00.850 --> 00:06:03.500
You'll end up like me if
you don't work hard...

107
00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:05.460
I am working hard.

108
00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:08.070
You're more tactful than I thought.

109
00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:14.230
Shall we head straight for the goal,
or shall we sink them instead?

110
00:06:14.590 --> 00:06:17.590
I enjoy the occasional leisurely trip across the goal line.

111
00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:19.640
But I wanna make that chick pay!

112
00:06:20.510 --> 00:06:23.270
Winning isn't enough for me now!

113
00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:24.700
What?!

114
00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:27.620
How is this?
Wonderful, Robin!

115
00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:29.540
Cheater!

116
00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:31.740
Let go!

117
00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:34.380
They already caught on. Too bad.

118
00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:36.010
Capote!

119
00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:39.170
How dare they?!

120
00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:44.110
Let's just keep moving!
We can't let 'em get a bigger lead!

121
00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:47.600
I guess I'll sink them after all.

122
00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:48.730
Oh!

123
00:06:49.140 --> 00:06:50.600
Ahh!

124
00:06:51.070 --> 00:06:55.880
Up ahead are the biggest obstacles
of the course: the Long Coral Reef

125
00:06:55.880 --> 00:07:01.510
and the Long Ring Whirlpool
of Long Cape beyond it!

126
00:07:01.510 --> 00:07:03.930
How will they overcome these?! And...

127
00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:05.680
Oh! Is that...?!

128
00:07:05.890 --> 00:07:06.810
What?

129
00:07:07.100 --> 00:07:09.100
There's someone on the island!

130
00:07:11.310 --> 00:07:13.110
It's "Full Dash" Hamburg!

131
00:07:13.110 --> 00:07:17.310
Atop him, making an appearance at last...
is the Master of Obstruction!

132
00:07:17.310 --> 00:07:21.110
The great scoundrel who
hates fairness; our boss!

133
00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:24.280
"Silver Fox" Foxy!

134
00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:25.830
Him!

135
00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:28.500
I just got an evil idea!

136
00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:31.530
The race is really heating up!

137
00:07:31.530 --> 00:07:34.410
The Long Coral Reef blocks
the course directly ahead!

138
00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:37.070
In the lead is Porche-chan's Cutie Wagon!

139
00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:40.980
Look! It's causing strange-acting currents!

140
00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:44.320
We can't just plunge in recklessly...

141
00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:48.110
Yuck! I can't believe the
race has lasted this long...

142
00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:50.070
Monda! We're counting on you!

143
00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:54.600
But let's not forget there's someone
on land just hoping to interfere:

144
00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:58.120
our boss, "Silver Fox" Foxy!

145
00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:01.580
Just what does he have in store?!

146
00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:06.730
Some inari sushi and
kitsune udon! No charge!

147
00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:08.700
For real?! Thanks! Yum!

148
00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:15.420
We'd love to have a cook like you join us!

149
00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:17.590
Your twirly eyebrow's so cute!

150
00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:22.310
Oh! Maybe I should be Davy Backed right now!

151
00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:25.910
Hey! Some more drinks over here!

152
00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:27.910
Have all you want!

153
00:08:27.910 --> 00:08:29.250
Thanks guys!

154
00:08:29.890 --> 00:08:33.420
Get 'em, Boss! 
Yahoo! Just a matter o' time now!

155
00:08:33.420 --> 00:08:34.930
Oh what's this?!

156
00:08:36.050 --> 00:08:38.620
C'mon Nami! Paddle!
Not yet!

157
00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:40.740
But they're getting ahead!

158
00:08:40.740 --> 00:08:42.950
I said not yet!

159
00:08:42.970 --> 00:08:48.320
The Cutie Wagon uses this
chance to continue forward and plunge into the Long Coral Reef!

160
00:08:48.320 --> 00:08:50.010
Let's go, Monda!

161
00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:54.600
Wait! Oh my! What's happening?!

162
00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:55.600
Monda!

163
00:08:57.730 --> 00:08:59.150
Oh... They came back.

164
00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:01.860
Oh my! The Cutie Wagon
has been sent backwards!

165
00:09:01.860 --> 00:09:03.280
What in the world happened?!

166
00:09:03.650 --> 00:09:04.950
No! Why?!

167
00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:08.540
See? I knew something
was up with these currents.

168
00:09:10.010 --> 00:09:12.090
Okay! Let's increase speed!

169
00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:13.050
R-Right!

170
00:09:13.160 --> 00:09:15.030
Try again Monda!

171
00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:16.000
This way!

172
00:09:19.970 --> 00:09:21.440
Whoa! What the...?!

173
00:09:25.680 --> 00:09:27.850
Ahh! There it is at last!

174
00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:31.110
Devilish interference from you-know-who!

175
00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:32.790
A smoke screen...!

176
00:09:34.330 --> 00:09:35.910
Oh my!

177
00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:41.930
Operation White Out is a great success!

178
00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:45.490
Let's see you find your way
through this coral maze blind!

179
00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:47.360
Success?

180
00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:51.530
How in the...?!

181
00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:56.230
They got through! With no
trouble at all! How did they do it?!

182
00:09:56.230 --> 00:09:57.670
Just as I thought!

183
00:09:57.680 --> 00:09:59.190
Meanwhile the Cutie Wagon...

184
00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:02.570
Oh no!
...has been sent back again!

185
00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:06.180
What's going on?!
The boat's moving on its own!

186
00:10:06.390 --> 00:10:09.370
This is a maze of sea currents.
Of sea currents?

187
00:10:09.660 --> 00:10:12.290
Yep. The whirlpool up ahead is

188
00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:14.620
causing strange currents in this reef,

189
00:10:14.620 --> 00:10:16.670
full of smaller whirlpools.

190
00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:19.250
So we don't need to see ahead!

191
00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:24.260
The currents will carry us through...
as long as we take the right entrance!

192
00:10:24.260 --> 00:10:28.300
Awesome! That's the power of our navigator!

193
00:10:28.300 --> 00:10:29.920
Hurray!

194
00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:32.680
Curses!

195
00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:40.580
But their joy is short-lived!
Beyond the coral forest is the Long Ring!

196
00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:42.990
Usopp! Quit freaking out and fire it!

197
00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:45.290
Fire what?!
An Impact!

198
00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:50.030
I-I told you we don't have it! Nope!
Oh? Then what's this?

199
00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:52.750
When did you...?!

200
00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:56.810
Hurry! Before the whirlpool sucks us in!

201
00:10:56.890 --> 00:11:00.230
It's okay! I don't mind!
'Cause it's my shoulder!

202
00:11:00.230 --> 00:11:03.880
No wonder you seemed so calm!

203
00:11:03.880 --> 00:11:06.340
You had this in mind from the start...

204
00:11:06.570 --> 00:11:07.620
Fine!

205
00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:10.850
Oh! The Barrel Tiger...

206
00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:13.800
No, more than that! They're flying!

207
00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:16.650
The Barrel Tiger takes a miraculously big lead!

208
00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:22.000
Does this spell defeat for
the indomitable Cutie Wagon?!

209
00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:24.250
We underestimated them a bit!

210
00:11:24.390 --> 00:11:25.210
We're counting on you!

211
00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:27.650
Combine!

212
00:11:28.190 --> 00:11:30.660
Two Fish Engine!

213
00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:33.200
No! They haven't lost yet!

214
00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:36.920
Their fishman muscle and shark fin
combo doubles their engine speed!

215
00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:40.770
They zip through the coral and
turbulent waves to close the gap!

216
00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:44.720
The race is half over!

217
00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:47.800
Meanwhile the Barrel Tiger
paddles desperately!

218
00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:49.180
Get up Usopp!

219
00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:52.680
Where am I?
Just start paddling!

220
00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:55.160
Your arm is twisted in an odd direction.

221
00:11:57.690 --> 00:11:58.690
What's that?

222
00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:01.090
It's a course marker.
It says to go right.

223
00:12:01.190 --> 00:12:03.480
Okay! Right we go!

224
00:12:03.650 --> 00:12:04.990
Like we'd fall for that!

225
00:12:06.320 --> 00:12:11.770
Oh my! Our boss's Ploy #18,
"Operation Lie to Them" has failed!

226
00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:17.210
Truly formidable! Does this girl
not believe anything?!

227
00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:18.850
Shut up you!

228
00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:20.420
She's foul-mouthed too!

229
00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:25.500
The race continues!
Barrel Tiger is still in the lead!

230
00:12:27.880 --> 00:12:31.330
What are these columns of water?!

231
00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:35.360
They also clear the long waves
that reach high into the sky!

232
00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:36.890
Natural phenomenon?!

233
00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:38.410
Granny...

234
00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:40.910
Bos-, no, Granny...

235
00:12:40.980 --> 00:12:44.190
Yeah... I think I'm done for...

236
00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:47.530
Our boss unleashes a third nasty trick!

237
00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:51.910
Oh! You on the boat! Please save me!

238
00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:56.250
Unbelievable! She completely
ignores a helpless, sick grandmother!

239
00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:59.180
Is she heartless, or does she
only care about herself?!

240
00:12:59.180 --> 00:13:01.920
Whatever the case,
Navigator Nami has a heart of ice!

241
00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:06.300
Will you shut up already?!
I'd never fall for that crap!

242
00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:07.970
She's foul-mouthed too!

243
00:13:11.150 --> 00:13:12.930
Look! It's the goal!

244
00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:17.770
The finish is close at hand!

245
00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:19.690
Not so fast!

246
00:13:20.630 --> 00:13:22.410
The Cutie Wagon has caught up!

247
00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:25.350
Who will be the winner of
Round #1's Donut Race?!

248
00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:28.770
Who will be the winner?!

249
00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:32.150
I told you...

250
00:13:32.630 --> 00:13:34.670
Cut it out! You're annoying!

251
00:13:35.730 --> 00:13:39.480
She even sees through "Operation Fake Goal"!

252
00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:41.640
Formidable! Truly formidable!

253
00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:46.860
I have a question for her now!
What does it mean to "believe"?

254
00:13:46.860 --> 00:13:47.960
I don't care!

255
00:13:47.960 --> 00:13:51.860
Oh it's too late! Her heart's
already closed! She's a heathen!

256
00:13:52.210 --> 00:13:54.070
The real goal is near though.

257
00:13:54.070 --> 00:13:57.820
No more Impacts!
Yeah I know!

258
00:13:58.060 --> 00:14:02.940
Meanwhile Porche-chan's team has
tragically stopped at the fake goal!

259
00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:06.710
What happened to the race?
Hey! Where is everyone?!

260
00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:09.630
The purity of your heart is dazzling!

261
00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:11.970
But you've been duped!
Pay attention Porche-chan!

262
00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:13.960
So many idiots!

263
00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:17.350
I'll be too embarrassed to live
if we lose to these guys!

264
00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:19.730
They'll take our crew too! That's even worse!

265
00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:22.570
Oh no! This goal is a fake!

266
00:14:22.850 --> 00:14:25.480
What?! Who would be so evil?!

267
00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:26.150
Eep!

268
00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:31.070
The Barrel Tiger is finally
approaching Long Bamboo Cape!

269
00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:34.310
The goal is just beyond it!
This is the homestretch!

270
00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:37.410
He's right! There's the goal!

271
00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:39.000
Wait!

272
00:14:39.430 --> 00:14:41.720
But they're catching up to us!

273
00:14:41.720 --> 00:14:43.380
We're no match for their speed!

274
00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:46.230
That's it Usopp! Can you
knock that bamboo down?!

275
00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:46.970
The bamboo?!

276
00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:48.590
All right!

277
00:14:50.800 --> 00:14:52.550
Like that?!
Do more!

278
00:14:52.860 --> 00:14:55.470
Full speed Capote! Monda!

279
00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:57.890
We have to sink them!

280
00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:04.550
Wow! Bingo!

281
00:15:05.890 --> 00:15:08.040
Oh no! Capote!

282
00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:10.520
They'll pay for this!

283
00:15:10.770 --> 00:15:13.200
Cutie Baton!

284
00:15:14.270 --> 00:15:16.440
What's that? Flower magic?

285
00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:19.480
Flower Shurikens!

286
00:15:20.780 --> 00:15:23.080
Ah they're throwing stars... Yikes!

287
00:15:25.280 --> 00:15:26.990
Oh no! We've sprung a leak!

288
00:15:26.990 --> 00:15:30.120
It's okay! We can make it!
The goal is right there!

289
00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:30.870
Let's make a run for it!

290
00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:35.920
Round #1 of the Davy Back Fight;
the Donut Race...

291
00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:40.150
Is about to reach a conclusion!

292
00:15:40.260 --> 00:15:43.730
Stay strong Monda! We
can't let them beat us!

293
00:15:44.850 --> 00:15:48.420
We'll lose if we don't do something!
Stay in line with them!

294
00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:49.450
Right Boss!

295
00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:53.560
Nami-san! Robin-chan!

296
00:15:53.560 --> 00:15:55.450
You speedy ladies are lovely!

297
00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:57.290
Man you guys almost won...

298
00:15:57.500 --> 00:15:59.330
Huh? We are winning!

299
00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:02.790
For now! But look!

300
00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:07.130
Our boss is there!
So?! What can he do now?!

301
00:16:07.130 --> 00:16:09.190
Our boss is just like you.

302
00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:11.760
He has Devil Fruit powers.

303
00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:15.710
Slow Beam!

304
00:16:25.440 --> 00:16:28.570
And the winner is the Cutie Wagon!

305
00:16:28.570 --> 00:16:34.960
Our idol Porche-chan has won the first round of the Davy Back Fight!

306
00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:36.950
All right! Way to go!

307
00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:39.120
Oh! Thanks everyone!

308
00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:42.870
You're the greatest Porche-chan!
It's only natural I won!

309
00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:46.150
Now let's swipe us a crew member!

310
00:16:46.850 --> 00:16:49.800
No one's a match for the Foxy Pirates!

311
00:16:54.300 --> 00:16:55.230
Wha...?

312
00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:04.100
All right! Time for you to
hand over a crew member!

313
00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:07.120
Are you guys hurt?! Are you okay?!

314
00:17:07.120 --> 00:17:08.680
Yes we're all right.

315
00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:10.990
What happened?

316
00:17:10.990 --> 00:17:12.660
Beats us...

317
00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:16.090
That's what we'd like to know!
Did we end up losing?

318
00:17:16.410 --> 00:17:20.440
You were about to win, but then you suddenly got slow and they passed you

319
00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:25.580
There's no need to be mystified!

320
00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:28.040
It was caused by Slowmo Photons!

321
00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:30.800
Hey! What did you do to Nami's team?!

322
00:17:31.370 --> 00:17:32.760
Slowmo Photons...?

323
00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:36.310
They're a type of particle
unlike anything currently known.

324
00:17:37.350 --> 00:17:39.360
Whatever this light touches--

325
00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:41.360
whether it's alive, liquid, or even gas--

326
00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:44.500
it physically loses a fixed amount of speed

327
00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:47.300
while retaining all other energy.

328
00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:49.820
I don't get it! Are you stupid or something?!

329
00:17:49.940 --> 00:17:52.780
He snapped at me...
Oh no! Boss!

330
00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:55.740
But that sounds too ridiculous...

331
00:17:55.860 --> 00:17:58.740
...to be real?

332
00:17:58.740 --> 00:18:03.460
You surely know that such childish claims have no merit in these waters!

333
00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:05.960
Everything they touch slows down!

334
00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:07.630
That's the power of Slowmo Photons!

335
00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:10.210
Oh now that makes sense!

336
00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:14.050
After eating the Slow Slow Fruit
I became a "slow person"

337
00:18:14.050 --> 00:18:16.100
capable of producing these
particles from my body!

338
00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:17.260
Observe its power!

339
00:18:20.640 --> 00:18:22.680
Yikes! He slowed a flying cannonball!

340
00:18:23.180 --> 00:18:24.800
Slow Beam!

341
00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:28.960
The effect lasts approximately thirty seconds.

342
00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:33.150
It'll regain its original speed afterward,
as if nothing had happened.

343
00:18:36.110 --> 00:18:38.200
Can't believe your eyes? This is--!

344
00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:41.450
Boss!

345
00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:44.790
Crap! So that's what happened to us?!

346
00:18:45.260 --> 00:18:48.880
So this is the reason they're
strangely confident about the game.

347
00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:50.540
What a joke of a power...

348
00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:55.270
Do you get it now?! You lost!

349
00:18:55.270 --> 00:18:57.130
Victory in Round #1's Donut Race...

350
00:18:57.530 --> 00:18:59.140
goes to us!

351
00:18:59.220 --> 00:19:01.720
Oh my! You were so close too!

352
00:19:01.890 --> 00:19:04.310
That concludes Round #1!

353
00:19:04.310 --> 00:19:07.230
Now for the long-awaited spoils of war!

354
00:19:07.230 --> 00:19:10.250
It's time to call one member
of the opposing crew!

355
00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:22.700
The first person I want is...

356
00:19:23.490 --> 00:19:24.200
you!

357
00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:27.220
The ship doctor! Tony Tony Chopper!

358
00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:28.920
Me?!

359
00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:31.120
Bring him here at once!

360
00:19:31.380 --> 00:19:33.090
Oh no! Chopper!

361
00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:38.950
What a rare creature!
You're way softer than I imagined!

362
00:19:38.950 --> 00:19:42.040
Oh Boss! Let me touch him too!

363
00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:43.510
Nauseatingly cute!

364
00:19:43.680 --> 00:19:45.080
He's ours now!

365
00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:49.260
Chopper!

366
00:19:51.320 --> 00:19:54.100
So that creep was after Chopper?

367
00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:57.580
Well I guess he is the
rarest of rare animals...

368
00:19:57.580 --> 00:19:59.200
He's into cute things?

369
00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:00.860
Or furs perhaps?

370
00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:02.710
This is no time to chat!

371
00:20:02.710 --> 00:20:05.370
This is serious!
They just took our friend!

372
00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:07.700
Guys...

373
00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:13.240
All right Dr. Chopper.
You're a member of my crew now.

374
00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:17.210
You need to pledge loyalty to me!
Now, put on this mask...

375
00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:21.150
Guys...!

376
00:20:22.010 --> 00:20:25.670
I'm sorry we lost Chopper...!

377
00:20:25.670 --> 00:20:26.700
Damn!

378
00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:30.730
This is a true rarity!

379
00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:34.060
A talking reindeer! Amazing!

380
00:20:34.690 --> 00:20:36.230
Let's be buddies!

381
00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:38.610
Yo! Comrade!

382
00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:44.240
Guys!

383
00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:48.870
I only set sail so I could be with you guys!

384
00:20:49.330 --> 00:20:53.250
No! I-I don't want this!

385
00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:58.090
Luffy! I only set sail
because you invited me to!

386
00:20:58.090 --> 00:21:00.510
I don't wanna go with these guys...!

387
00:21:00.750 --> 00:21:07.560
No! I'm the Straw Hat Pirates'
ship doctor, Tony Tony Chopper!

388
00:21:09.470 --> 00:21:11.310
I don't want this!

389
00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:15.110
Quit your griping, Chopper!

390
00:21:15.810 --> 00:21:17.320
You're being a poor sport!

391
00:21:18.050 --> 00:21:19.160
Zoro...

392
00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:22.110
You're the one who decided to set sail!

393
00:21:22.110 --> 00:21:24.560
No one else is to blame if
you end up dying somewhere!

394
00:21:24.560 --> 00:21:25.990
Only you are!

395
00:21:26.450 --> 00:21:28.340
We agreed to this game.

396
00:21:28.730 --> 00:21:31.650
Usopp and everyone else did their best!

397
00:21:32.840 --> 00:21:36.380
No one in the pirate world would
sympathize with your tears!

398
00:21:37.130 --> 00:21:38.310
A real man...

399
00:21:38.880 --> 00:21:41.470
...would roll up his sleeves and
watch the rest of the contest quietly!

400
00:21:43.130 --> 00:21:46.670
How can you say that?!
Don't you know how he feels?!

401
00:21:51.220 --> 00:21:54.450
All right! Do anything you like with me!

402
00:21:55.730 --> 00:21:56.770
Chopper...

403
00:21:57.240 --> 00:21:58.320
All right!

404
00:21:58.320 --> 00:22:01.090
Whoa!
That swordsman is awesome!

405
00:22:01.090 --> 00:22:03.590
All right! Teach 'em a lesson, Zoro!

406
00:22:03.590 --> 00:22:05.240
Get Chopper back!

407
00:22:05.240 --> 00:22:08.770
Let's take him next, Boss!
This reindeer's got guts!

408
00:22:08.770 --> 00:22:10.660
Let's get the second round started.

409
00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:13.330
So moving! I'm moved to tears!

410
00:22:13.730 --> 00:22:16.250
Yeah. There's still two rounds left.

411
00:22:17.000 --> 00:22:20.670
We're gonna take back our precious
emergency food... and then some.

412
00:22:20.670 --> 00:22:22.610
Sanji! We're counting on you!

413
00:22:22.610 --> 00:22:26.860
The exchange is finished as the Davy Back Fight suddenly explodes with excitement!

414
00:22:27.220 --> 00:22:30.200
Huh? Wait, Chopper's in the second round.

415
00:22:30.200 --> 00:22:32.560
But they took him.
You're right.

416
00:22:33.290 --> 00:22:34.980
That's the real thrill of this game!

417
00:22:35.270 --> 00:22:36.430
We told you!

418
00:22:36.430 --> 00:22:39.730
You can't change your roster!
No replacements allowed!

419
00:22:39.820 --> 00:22:42.190
In other words, only the other
two Straw Hat contestants...

420
00:22:42.190 --> 00:22:44.750
Can participate in Round #2's Groggy Ring!

421
00:22:44.750 --> 00:22:47.390
Team Foxy already has the advantage!

422
00:22:47.390 --> 00:22:48.200
What?!

423
00:22:48.580 --> 00:22:50.830
You can drop out too, if you want.

424
00:22:50.830 --> 00:22:53.410
No, but you can, loser.

425
00:22:53.740 --> 00:22:57.130
I find it hard to believe
they'll work as a team...

426
00:22:57.480 --> 00:22:59.250
Say what?!
Stop that!

427
00:22:59.590 --> 00:23:03.310
I'll now explain the rules of Groggy Ring!

428
00:23:03.310 --> 00:23:05.470
There's a field and two goals!

429
00:23:05.470 --> 00:23:07.480
Knock the balls into them and you win!

430
00:23:07.480 --> 00:23:10.200
However, the balls are no ordinary balls!

431
00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:11.580
They're people!

432
00:23:11.580 --> 00:23:15.230
Both teams, select someone to be a ball!

433
00:23:15.230 --> 00:23:17.980
Which of you's gonna be the ball?!

434
00:23:19.720 --> 00:23:20.810
Here's your ball mark!

435
00:23:21.020 --> 00:23:24.570
Who made you boss?!
You be the ball, Moss Head!

436
00:23:25.030 --> 00:23:28.970
Oh, there it is! Their entrance song!

437
00:23:28.970 --> 00:23:32.160
It's the undefeated elites of Groggy Ring!

438
00:23:32.160 --> 00:23:36.040
Yes! Defeat is impossible for them!

439
00:23:38.080 --> 00:23:38.960
Crush 'em!

440
00:23:39.330 --> 00:23:45.930
The famous Groggy Monsters
have just taken the field!

441
00:23:48.030 --> 00:23:50.510
At the lead is "Full Dash" Hamburg!

442
00:23:50.890 --> 00:23:54.560
He's followed by "Tackle Machine" Pickles!

443
00:23:55.210 --> 00:24:01.150
Last but not least is Big Pan the wotan;
a half-fishman half-giant!

444
00:24:01.610 --> 00:24:05.070
This is literally a monstrous march!

445
00:24:05.070 --> 00:24:08.530
Now, then!

446
00:24:11.650 --> 00:24:12.780
What is that?!

447
00:24:14.260 --> 00:24:16.290
What is that giant fishman?!

448
00:24:17.250 --> 00:24:19.210
They're putting the ball mark on him!

449
00:24:20.830 --> 00:24:22.040
Let's see you win this!

450
00:24:27.510 --> 00:24:28.400
Seem like a good match?

451
00:24:31.170 --> 00:24:32.300
Yep.
